{"steam_appid":2186320,"steam_name":"Ages of Conflict: World War Simulator","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2186320/660405/1086a7ea73120297130959d31e49efa23b1d4df3/1750797368/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762771721","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256999867/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1762771721","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/6e418edd86c2c93e59171cad1b693b53d942a448/ss_6e418edd86c2c93e59171cad1b693b53d942a448.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784574122","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/9c4d341d2edc7a196835ed89ae3b34ba91cdfcc0/ss_9c4d341d2edc7a196835ed89ae3b34ba91cdfcc0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784574122","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/d85f9be5477b977161c2e605f388a7bc62714b8a/ss_d85f9be5477b977161c2e605f388a7bc62714b8a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784574122","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/e15113f9300ce7a5bc853d0897d642f2af79f68a/ss_e15113f9300ce7a5bc853d0897d642f2af79f68a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784574122","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/0cd5f1964d5843e0979f46491be5968efce9d298/ss_0cd5f1964d5843e0979f46491be5968efce9d298.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784574122"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Simulation with High Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you observe customized AI nations battle it out to ultimately try to control the world in a massive free-for-all, featuring alliances, revolts, puppet states and all kinds of political twists!<br><strong>NOTE: This is not a Strategy Game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/f082cf73809ebef2a465690de1903e77.poster.avif?t=1784574122\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/f082cf73809ebef2a465690de1903e77.webm?t=1784574122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/f082cf73809ebef2a465690de1903e77.mp4?t=1784574122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extensive Map Creator + God Mode Tools</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game comes with premade Maps and Scenarios, but you can unleash your creativity by making your own! <u><strong>Make your maps and borders as complex as you like!</strong></u><strong> </strong>Check out <strong><u>hundreds of High Quality Scenarios on Steam Workshop</u></strong> from historical periods to fantasy worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/2d09cc45c381e983087e7e26ed2f3e88.poster.avif?t=1784574122\" width=600 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/2d09cc45c381e983087e7e26ed2f3e88.webm?t=1784574122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/2d09cc45c381e983087e7e26ed2f3e88.mp4?t=1784574122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Govern world history by controlling nations directly. Carefully edit borders, terrain, nation stats and AI behaviour at any point during the simulation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View the whole History of your simulations and Statistics to get a better view of past events and nations long gone. With the right settings, the world can continue to change for thousands of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/cb76cb447c387992cc046976ae0d35cb.poster.avif?t=1784574122\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/cb76cb447c387992cc046976ae0d35cb.webm?t=1784574122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/cb76cb447c387992cc046976ae0d35cb.mp4?t=1784574122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are interested in <strong>History, Geography, Map Painting</strong> or watching chaos unfold, Ages of Conflict has got you covered!</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8250U 1.60 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 180 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 16:9 recommended</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["JoySpark Games"],"publishers":["JoySpark Games"],"release_date":"17 Feb, 2023"}